{
    "2": {
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're a human, I see."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just what I needed."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I shall drain every drop"
            ]
        },
        "300_0": {
            "lines": [
                "of spring from you!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This ominous feeling..."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Doesn't make me happy at all."
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So this is why everyone here is noisy..."
            ]
        },
        "102_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Half-Phantom Gardener",
                "Youmu Konpaku"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...It must be because of a living human."
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...Don't tell me, this place is..."
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This is the place where the used-to-be-living reside."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The world of the dead?",
                "I see, I was invited somehow."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You have not yet been invited."
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In any case..."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How can a normal person enter the world of the dead so easily?",
                "That's just too dangerous."
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You broke the barrier on your way here,",
                "didn't you!?"
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That one opened right up."
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That barrier was a \"DO NOT ENTER\" sign..."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're like a kid climbing a pole that says",
                "\"DANGER: DO NOT CLIMB.\""
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Selfishly tearing it, then saying ",
                "\"That's just too dangerous\"? Nonsense."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're quite a talkative phantom."
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm half non-phantom!"
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's what you corrected?"
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "At any rate—with just a little more spring—"
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Saigyou Ayakashi will soon reach full bloom."
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The tiny trace of spring that you brought here,"
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "will give us the last step needed."
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're quite a talkative half-phantom."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Were you listening?"
            ]
        },
        "125_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm going to cut you down here and you'll meet your end."
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If I die in the world of the dead,",
                "would I still be sent to the world of the dead?"
            ]
        },
        "127_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You will be sent to hell."
            ]
        },
        "128_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, so this place isn't hell is it?"
            ]
        },
        "129_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...The things that cannot be cut by my Roukanken, ",
                "forged by Youkai..."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are next to none!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's enough spring here already."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are you trying to do?"
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The young mistress would like to see ",
                "perfect cherry blossoms this year."
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This level of spring is not enough for ",
                "the Saigyou Ayakashi to bloom fully..."
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And is full bloom... a good thing?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A human, I see."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're just what I need."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll be taking it all..."
            ]
        },
        "300_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Every last bit of your spring!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ahh, it's gettin' a lot warmer."
            ]
        },
        "100_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So this is what all the commotion was about..."
            ]
        },
        "101_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Half-Phantom Gardener",
                "Youmu Konpaku"
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're a <i$living> human."
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There wouldn't be a commotion if I were a corpse?"
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No, not at all."
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A human arriving at Hakugyokurou..."
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Should mean death in and of itself."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm pretty sure I'm alive."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yet you went beyond that barrier of your own volition."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's no wonder your folly was causing",
                "a commotion amongst the spirits."
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Say, this place sure is nice 'n warm."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I should hope so. The essence of ",
                "Gensokyo's spring has been gathered here."
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ordinary cherry blossoms are in a bloom beyond compare."
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Corpses havin' a pleasant flower viewing.",
                "How elegant."
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yet even this is not enough to bring",
                "the Saigyou Ayakashi to full bloom..."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Saigyou Ayakashi?"
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The youkai cherry blossom, our pride and joy."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, now you've got me curious."
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "More to the point, with just the slightest bit more",
                "spring, even our Saigyou Ayakashi will fully blossom."
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That trace of spring you brought here..."
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...will be the final touch, so to speak."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After the trouble I went through gatherin' all this?",
                "Don't think I'll be handin' it over that easily!"
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All we need is that final touch!"
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I have a better idea. ",
                "Why don't I take all the spring you've gathered..."
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...And make that youkai cherry blossom bloom myself?"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I won't be handing over any spring I've gathered."
            ]
        },
        "125_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Me neither."
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The things that cannot be cut by my Roukanken, ",
                "forged by youkai..."
            ]
        },
        "127_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...are next to none!\u0014(TL note: A play off of Goemon Ishikawa XIII's line \"There is nothing my Zantetsuken cannot cut,\" from the series Lupin the Third.)"
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now then, why don't I have you show",
                "me the way to that youkai tree?"
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well... As long as the Saigyou Ayakashi ",
                "is brought to full bloom..."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can't say I'm happy about it, though."
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who said I was gonna bloom the Saigyou Ayakashi?"
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I just wanna go flower-viewin'."
            ]
        }
    },
    "22": {
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're a human, I see."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just what I needed."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I shall drain every drop"
            ]
        },
        "300_0": {
            "lines": [
                "of spring from you!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Come on out."
            ]
        },
        "100_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So this is why everyone here is noisy..."
            ]
        },
        "101_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Half-Phantom Gardener",
                "Youmu Konpaku"
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...It must be because of a living human."
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Finally, I've reached the source."
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It took me a whole day to get here."
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In coming here,",
                "you have exercised great composure."
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This is Hakugyokurou."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The deceased live on in this place."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Acting on the common sense of",
                "the living will land you in a mess."
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The dead do not speak."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, return the spring you stole."
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It shall happen soon."
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's a little bit too long."
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Soon, the Saigyou Ayakashi will",
                "reach full bloom."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That could never happen with a normal spring."
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I said I don't care."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The trace of spring you brought here could",
                "bring the Saigyou Ayakashi to full bloom."
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you even listening to me?"
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've traveled through that cold only to find",
                "such a selfish idea."
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But it's warm here isn't it?"
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's enough already."
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Dead people have no mouths."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Indeed, dead people have no mouths."
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I will consume the warmth of your spring."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I wonder, can my knives even cut phantoms?"
            ]
        },
        "125_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...The things that cannot be cut by my Roukanken, ",
                "forged by Youkai..."
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are close to none!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "21": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Cool. Looks like these knives actually work."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Maybe because they're silver?"
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm half non-phantom, you know."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But mistress Saigyouji is fully spirit-bodied."
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Do you expect to be a challenge",
                "using those trinkets for weapons?"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wait, why are we already talking",
                "about that battle?"
            ]
        }
    }
}